[en.IDEA_C23_STORM_OF_MARCH]
“Storm of March” Aftermath

[en.IDEA_C23_STORM_OF_MARCH_desc]
At the most dangerous moment during the “Storm of March”, the Free Equestria regime was considered to be on its last legs. Fortunately, we survived this crisis.
We paid our fair and painful price: the military government collapsed, and the public lost confidence in Free Equestria; the new democratic government has no control over many areas of Storm Island, and various regions have turned a deaf ear to the federal government’s orders; we were also forced to withdraw from the United Resistance due to public opinion. Worse still, some forces lurking in the shadows have begun to stir, binding their strength in dark places we cannot see.

[zh.IDEA_C23_STORM_OF_MARCH]
“三月风暴”的余波

[zh.IDEA_C23_STORM_OF_MARCH_desc]
“三月风暴”最危险的那段时间里，自由小马利亚政权被认为命不久矣。幸运的是，我们顶住了这次危机。
我们付出了我们应得的惨痛代价：军政府垮台，民众对于自由小马利亚已经失去信心；新的民主政权却无力完全控制风暴岛上的每一片区域，各地对于联邦政府的命令置若罔闻；我们也迫于民意退出了联合抵抗组织。更糟的是，一些潜藏在阴影里的势力开始蠢蠢欲动，在我们看不见的地方增强着他们的力量。
